# Weather & Time Agent Configuration
# ==============================
#
# To get your OpenWeatherMap API key:
# 1. Go to https://openweathermap.org/api
# 2. Sign up for a free account
# 3. Go to your account's "My API keys" section
# 4. Copy your API key
# 5. Replace YOUR_API_KEY below with your actual API key
#
# Example: OPENWEATHER_API_KEY=1234567890abcdef1234567890abcdef

OPENWEATHER_API_KEY=47e4799092cc649257b4799b9999c543 
